WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.970
Ten days apart.
The same top three.

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:05.870
On November fourth
and November fourteenth,

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:07.670
all four comparative answers ranked

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:09.470
Purina Pro Plan first,

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.130
Hill's Science Diet second,

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.690
and Royal Canin third.

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:14.750
Each Recoscope snapshot captured

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.350
twelve usable answers,

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.550
across four AI assistants
and three prompt types.

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:23.250
Pro Plan appeared in ten of twelve
answers on both dates.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.990
But the under-seventy-dollar prompt
still changed visibility.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:31.650
Purina ONE appeared in all four budget
answers on November fourteenth;

00:00:31.650 --> 00:00:33.030
Iams appeared in three.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:35.430
These are two captured snapshots,

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.910
not proof of stable AI behavior.

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:39.450
Assistant settings changed,

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:43.570
and mentions don't verify price,
suitability, or product quality.

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:48.300
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
